UID:redacted@example.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261124T051542Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261124T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261124T200000
SUMMARY:Adult Volleyball Skills Clinic and Training
DESCRIPTION:North Texas Adult Volleyball\nJoin others just like you from b
 eginner to advanced (we split everyone up into groups by skill) and work o
 n your development so you can play at your very best.\n\nFounder\, interna
 tional pro coach Jordan Wendelken\, builds every training curriculum off h
 is 15+ years of coaching around the world! Each training is made so that y
 ou can reach your very best in only 1 HOUR!\n\nClinics focus on body mecha
 nics and alternate between passing\, setting\, hitting\, serving\, digging
 /diving\, defense\, offense\, and gameplay. We believe all skills are nece
 ssary to make a well-rounded player so we do not announce or post the skil
 l topic in advance. Come solo ready to learn with others just like you or 
 bring a friend or group. Only $20 drop-in rate or included in our membersh
 ips.\n\nSee why this is the most successful and popular clinic in the worl
 d right here in DFW!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-texas-adult-volleyball/events/3
 17293352/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261105T013635Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261105T013635Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
