BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:redacted@example.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261124T051542Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261125T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261125T220000
SUMMARY:Adult Beginner Open Gym Volleyball Lewisville
DESCRIPTION:North Texas Adult Volleyball\nOur Beginner open gyms are the B
 EST in Texas because we do our best to make them fair and properly managed
 .\n\nYOU MUST REGISTER AND PAY IN OUR APP\, REGISTERING HERE WONT ALLOW YO
 U ENTRY. GO TO USSPT.COM AND DOWNLOAD THE APP THEN SELECT EVENTS THEN VOLL
 EYBALL AND THEN YOUR LEVEL OF OPEN GYM\n\n***Come solo or with a group\, d
 rop-in rate is $10 or for $50 a month\, you get unlimited open gym\, which
  we have every day!***\n\n**FORMAT**\nWarm-up (come 30 min early FREE)\nWe
  start with 30 min of SideOut or Queen of the Court or til everyone arrive
 s and then split up players for teams.\n\nWhen fully attended (35 checked 
 in attendees)\, we divide players up into 5 teams based on position and sk
 ill to even teams out. We place 7 players on a team so that Liberos get a 
 chance to hone their skill AND so all positions rotate back row and learn 
 proper rotations.\n\nWE ARE A TRAINING FACILITY and we focus on players ge
 tting better\, thats why we want to play properly and not have Iron Middle
 s or high scoring hitters not rotating\, it's simply unfair.\n\nBest of al
 l\, if your teams loses on court 1\, you play back to back until you win A
 ND if you win on court 2\, you play back to back until you lose. We built 
 USSPT for players and athletes that want to have fun and get better.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-texas-adult-volleyball/events/3
 17308722/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261106T022952Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261106T022952Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
